Source attribution
------------------

The data is derived from the following upstream sources, whose required
credits must be kept when you redistribute it:

1. Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information 2026.
   Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that
   may be made of the Copernicus information or data it contains.
   Source dataset: Hersbach, H. et al. (2023), ERA5 hourly data on single
   levels from 1940 to present, Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S)
   Climate Data Store (CDS), DOI 10.24381/cds.adbb2d47.
   Licence to use Copernicus Products:
   https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/licences/licence-to-use-copernicus-products

2. Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0), https://open-meteo.com/
   Historical Weather API, licence: https://open-meteo.com/en/licence
